## ⚠️ 3. Starter Pitfalls (e.g. `AIBiz-Automatyzacje/claude-code-starter`)

- **Frontend-only stack lock**: Pre-configured for React 19 + Vite + Supabase + Tailwind, breaking polyglot microservice workflows.
- **Language pollution**: Polish filenames and prompts (`klasa-mechaniczny.md`, `env-wartosci.mjs`) waste context tokens in non-Polish repos.
- **Token saturation**: Spawning 7+ reviewer subagents simultaneously burns API budget and slows down iterative vibe coding.
